(Adapted from \cite{LWX126}, Example 6.19; \cite{BHS}, Thm. A.8.)\par{}

\begin{enumerate}
\item The normalized Hopf map $\nu\in\pi_{3,4}S^{0,0}$ has first-quotient label $h_2$.
